ture  especially living in the city that  I don't think about it anymore for CBS  this morning Carter Evans San Francisco  well we reached out to the Los Angeles  County Public Defender's Office which is  representing Morales they were unable to  comment overnight another note make sure  you checked before you get in the car  and safe
 

